    skos:altLabel 'AIRMAR'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Airmar Technology Corporation'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An ultrasonic sensor technology company specialising in the design and manufacture of high-performance ultrasonic transducers and sensors. Founded in 1982 and headquartered in Milford, New Hampshire, their products are widely used in marine, industrial, and commercial applications, including fish-finding transducers, weather stations, and flow sensors.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0319'^^xsd:string .
