    dc:modified '2024-10-21T13:53:51'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'OIS'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Ocean Imaging Systems'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A US-based company specialising in the design and construction of high quality oceanographic imaging systems for both shallow and deep water applications. The Ocean Imaging Systems product line began in 2002 but some imaging products were originally designed by Benthos Inc. and have been redesigned and updated. OIS is a division of EP Oceanographic LLC.'@en ;
