    skos:prefLabel 'FEI Company'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A US-based company founded in 1971, headquartered in Hillsboro, Oregon, specialising in the design and manufacturing of microscope technology. FEI is now a subsidary of Thermo Fisher Scientific following acquisition in 2016, becoming a part of Thermo Fisher\'s Analytical Instruments Segment.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0300'^^xsd:string .
