    skos:prefLabel 'Gems Sensors and Controls'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Gems designs and manufactures a broad portfolio of liquid level, flow switches and pressure switches, sensors and transducers, miniature solenoid valves, and pre-assembled fluidic systems. Founded in 1955, Gems Sensors is a division of Fortive Corporation.'@en ;
