    skos:altLabel 'NIOZ'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Royal Netherlands Institute For Sea Research'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The national oceanographic institute and the Netherlands\' centre of expertise for ocean, sea and coast. Areas of research include marine systems, the way they change, the role they play in climate and biodiversity, and how they may provide sustainable solutions to society in the future. NIOZ also maintains and operates a variety of seagoing equipment as part of their National Marine Facilities.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0286'^^xsd:string .
