    skos:prefLabel 'C-Nav Positioning Solutions'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A US-based designer and manufacturer of global satellite positioning services, having delivered the first commercial Precise Point Positioning (PPP) service. It was later incorporated into C&C Technologies, which in 2015 was acquired by Oceaneering International Inc.'@en ;
